        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Dear dad…”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Promise is a short, exploration game inspired by games such as Gone Home. As a father, you explore the empty home of your estranged daughter, Amy, after her death. Piece together the life you missed…one memory at a time. Follow the journey of regret and reconciliation as you try to comprehend the world she built without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void between you and Amy lasted years. Now, you explore a life you never shared, the missing chapters of her life from the estrangement to the twilight of her days. Your only guide is a collection of objects in her house, and a single letter she left behind for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short 15-30 minute story that can be experienced in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intimate story about loss, grief and acceptance</p></li></ul>",
